## 1. Review & Understand the Task

- The "At a glance" block lives in the solopreneur **Summary** section (`SolopreneurSummary.vue`), rendered by `SolopreneurView.vue`.
- Today it is a `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%,160px),1fr))` grid: on a phone each KPI card takes a full row (4 stacked rows), with `p-5` cards and a progress bar.
- Required: on **mobile** (narrow measured width) the 4 KPIs must sit in **one single row**, with **reduced size** and **icons**.
- Constraints of this screen: no media queries / container queries — the screen is hosted both full-width (route) and inside a dockview panel, so widths come from `state.viewport` measured by the view (`setViewportWidth`). Only tiers `isWide` (≥1024) and `isXl` (≥1280) exist today.

## 2. Information Gathering (from conversation/code)

- `useSolopreneur.js` → `tiers()` publishes `{ width, isWide, isXl }`; all components read `state.viewport.*`. No compact/phone tier exists.
- `SolopreneurSummary.vue` → `glance` computed: uptime, hours, tasks, projects. Markup: `<section p-6>` + header + auto-fit grid with `p-5` items and `h-1.5` progress bar.
- `i18n.js` → `gl.*` labels are long sentences ("Hours you got back", "Tâches réalisées pour vous"), unusable in a ~70px column.
- Icons: Font Awesome classes are already used in this folder (`<i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket">` in `SolopreneurSidebar.vue`).

## 3. Change Proposal

- Add a **compact tier** to the shared viewport state: `isCompact = width < 640` (phone / narrow panel), keeping the existing `isWide` / `isXl` logic untouched.
- In `SolopreneurSummary.vue` read that tier and render the glance block in two mutually exclusive variants:
  - **compact** → `grid-cols-4` (always one row), section `p-3`, `text-sm` title, items `rounded-lg px-1.5 py-2` centering an **icon**, a `text-sm` value and a 2-line `text-[10px]` short label; progress bars dropped.
  - **regular** → unchanged current cards (value, full label, progress bar).
- Add short label keys (`gl.uptimeShort`, `gl.hoursShort`, `gl.tasksShort`, `gl.projectsShort`) to EN/ES/FR so the compact labels are not truncated mid-word; full label kept in `title`.

Risks/edge cases: compact also triggers in a narrow dockview panel (intended); values are short strings so 4 columns fit down to ~320px; `line-clamp-2` keeps the row height stable.

## 4. Changes Summary

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `src/components/solopreneur/useSolopreneur.js` | Add `COMPACT_WIDTH` (640) and `isCompact` to `tiers()` + `setViewportWidth()`. |
| `src/components/solopreneur/SolopreneurSummary.vue` | `glance` items gain `icon` + `short` label; "At a glance" section renders a compact one-row icon strip on mobile. |
| `src/components/solopreneur/i18n.js` | Add `gl.*Short` labels for EN / ES / FR. |

## 5. The Changes

