- One row on mobile is guaranteed by `grid-cols-4` (not `auto-fit`), at every compact width down to ~320px.
- Icons come from the already-loaded Font Awesome set (`fa-signal`, `fa-clock`, `fa-list-check`, `fa-folder-open`).
- `isCompact` is a measured-width tier (`< 640`), so it also applies to a narrow dockview panel — no media/container queries, consistent with the rest of the screen.
- Regular (tablet/desktop) rendering is byte-for-byte the previous markup, including the progress bars.

